    "## 5. Ranking ties and percentiles\n",
    "\n",
    "NumCompute ranks in ascending order by default, so the smallest value gets rank 1. The `average`, `dense`, and `ordinal` methods differ when values tie. Negating scores reverses the meaning so the highest score receives rank 1."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "ef72f18d",
   "metadata": {
